00:26:03.080 --> 00:26:06.140
a community that's able to
improve maybe what you did

00:26:06.140 --> 00:26:07.480
and you didn't think about it.

00:26:07.480 --> 00:26:09.049
ADDISON HOWARD: Right.

00:26:09.049 --> 00:26:11.090
And we're starting to see
